+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2.1.13-7">If a certificate contains both a critical key usage field and a critical extended key usage field, then both fields <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be processed independently and the certificate <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> only be used for a purpose consistent with both fields.  If there is no purpose consistent with both fields, then the certificate <bcp14>MUST NOT</bcp14> be used for any purpose.</t>
